{"title":"2003 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Blake and Jenny each took four <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />-point tests. Blake averaged <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/d/76d15d808807bfa561e72dc8111649ed0a204ebe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$78$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> on the four tests. Jenny scored <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> points higher than Blake on the first test, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> points lower than him on the second test, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> points higher on both the third and fourth tests. What is the difference between Jenny's average and Blake's average on these four tests?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/5/7056eb63ac3d7a8d9f08bcf722f5c26b2a1e99bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\  10  \\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ 15 \\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 20 \\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 25 \\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"387\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Blake scored a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/d/bcddcdab916ea039e67536e739317b051598553e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 \\times 78=312$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"100\" height=\"13\" /> points. Jenny scored <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/3/3231c7b5fe8b631dfd2dcb593548117dd3b5da82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10-10+20+20=40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"181\" height=\"14\" /> points higher than Blake, so her average is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/a/5da5d232ca98dd7429b3779c4e8488edb0467e2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{312+40}{4}=88$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"113\" height=\"38\" />. \nthe difference is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/d/4fd9ae9efa995dc45069c025e6e3c6a3f8303f6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$88-78=\\boxed{\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"146\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>The total point difference between Blake's and Jenny's scores is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/3/3231c7b5fe8b631dfd2dcb593548117dd3b5da82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10-10+20+20=40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"181\" height=\"14\" />. The average of it is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/d/fddb5c4941045cd09b1248251779f1b01dfa11f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{40}{4}=\\boxed{\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"109\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8\" title=\"2003 AMC 8\">2003 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2003 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2003 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2003\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2003 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2003 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2003 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2003 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2003 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2003 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2003 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2003 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"